        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Libra &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>Rising Dragon. You strike upward and a column of water and cosmo climbs with your fist.</em></p><p>Each creature in the cylinder takes @Damage[1d10[bludgeoning]] damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature that critically fails is launched 30 feet straight up.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
